    <section class="faq" id="faq">
        <div class="section-badge-header">
            <span class="section-kicker">Good to know</span>
            <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>How do I choose my size?</summary>
                <p>Open the size guide next to the size selector. It lists chest, waist and length in centimetres for M to 2XL. If you are between two sizes, compare your chest and waist with the chart and pick the size that matches your larger measurement.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>How do I place an order?</summary>
                <p>Choose a fabric, then pick your fit, size and colour on its page and continue to checkout. There you add your details, drop a pin on the map for your delivery location, choose a payment method and confirm. No account is needed.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Which payment methods can I use?</summary>
                <p>Cash on delivery, Vodafone Cash and InstaPay. For Vodafone Cash and InstaPay you upload a screenshot of your payment at checkout, and we check it before confirming your order.</p>
            </details>
                        <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>
                <p>We deliver to your door in Greater Cairo and across Egypt, usually within 2-4 business days. The map pin you drop at checkout tells the courier exactly where to go.</p>
            </details>
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>Can I check the package when it arrives?</summary>
                <p>Yes. You can inspect your order on delivery.</p>
            </details>
            <!-- TODO(owner): replace with your real exchange policy (time window, conditions, how to contact you). -->
            <details class="faq-item">
                <summary>What if the fit is not right?</summary>
                <p>We offer a fit exchange. Please contact us after you receive your order and we will arrange it.</p>
            </details>
        </div>
    </section>
